  "_doc": "CordeliaApps' OWN brand theme — the chrome the shopper sees outside any store (splash, onboarding, auth, discovery). A store opened from discovery swaps this out for its template's config under assets/theme/templates/. Not 'activeTheme': '<preset>' + sibling light/dark blocks — AppThemeConfig.fromJson ignores sibling overrides once activeTheme resolves to a known preset, it only uses the preset's own map, so the whole palette is inlined here. The green scale below is derived from the brand mark's own gradient stops (assets/icons/cordelia-icon.svg: #007A60 deep -> #2DA987 light), replacing the purple #7059FF seed that predated the mark and clashed with it. Shape/typography stay sampled from the gravia kit — CordeliaApps has no kit of its own, and those metrics are pack-neutral.",
